Pin a shelf ornament so it stays put
Long-press the page number twice to switch to Spines
Long-press an ornament, here Baphomet
Tap Pin here
Pinned. A small menu opens to adjust it
Tap ‹ to nudge it one place left
Settings changes its size or tap action
Remove unpins it
Tap outside the menu to close it
Turn the page: other ornaments stand there
Back again: Baphomet is where you pinned it
